    <h2>ComponentStore&lt;T&gt;</h2>

    <p>
        Each component type gets a <code>ComponentStore&lt;T&gt;</code>.
        In the current implementation it uses a dictionary keyed by entity
        ID, a dense entity-ID list, and a dictionary mapping entity IDs
        to their list positions.
    </p>

    <p>
        Removal uses swap-with-last so the entity list can remove an item
        without shifting every later element. <code>Get</code> returns
        a reference into the dictionary value using
        <code>CollectionsMarshal.GetValueRefOrNullRef</code>.
    </p>

